{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:06.98] Molly got me spinnin'\n[00:08.92] Well,  welcome to my world, you know?\n[00:11.56] D-D-Daytrip  took it to ten (Hey!)\n[Chorus]\n[00:13.24] Molly make me spin, spend\n[00:15.20] All my money on her and all my time with her again\n[00:18.28] Hope  the party never ends\n[00:20.26] Looking  at my sins\n[00:21.00] They're pretty bad, but I could do worse with a grin\n[00:24.52] Let  the semi' blast, I won't let them hate on me again\n[00:27.62] I've been in my bag, I'ma blow the cash in the wind\n[00:30.56] She tryna run it back, I told her to throw it back again\n[00:33.72] I'm like a running back, I've been running plays in the bed\n[Verse]\n[00:37.20] Yeah,  every time I touch her, it turn to a touchdown\n[00:40.52] Molly got me hyper, I could never calm down\n[00:43.64] Shittin' on 'em, diaper, I know I'm the bomb now\n[00:46.76] I'm number-one in my town\n[00:48.32] I'm putting on for Chi-Town\n[00:49.84] Bites like a viper, but she ain't poison\n[00:52.94] Knew I had to wife her, she was gettin' annoyed by the same things I hate, ayy\n[00:57.64] That's why she bae, ayy\n[00:59.20] Be my dinner date, put it on my face\n[01:02.44] I won't tell them hard, I could stop, end my job\n[01:04.90] But do my job while she taking off her top\n[01:07.40] Get to kissing down her neck\n[01:09.00] Off the drugs, I can't stop\n[01:10.46] Wrote a phrase on her chest, said, \"Forget me, not\"\n[01:13.62] Tat' my name on her leg, I'ma kiss that spot\n[01:16.58] That's forever, it's in ink, won't forget that spot\n[01:19.90] All them other hoes irrelevant, fuck those thots\n[01:22.98] Me and you get Wi-Fi lit, we may go fuck those thots\n[Bridge]\n[01:26.10] Forget me, not\n[01:28.02] Won't forget, forget me, not\n[01:31.34] Won't forget, forget me, not (Forget me, not)\n[01:34.28] Won't forget, forget me, not\n[01:37.40] Won't forget, forget me, not (Forget me, not)\n[Chorus]\n[01:41.04] Molly make me spin, spend\n[01:42.48] All my money on her and al